    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a void i can just fill up with something else though. it feels permanent. like i'm just a shell performing tasks to stay alive, but the actual 'me'—the one that had purpose and felt real—is just gone for good. it feels like i'm just dragging this empty body around for no reason.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
