    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think anyone wants to listen to a ghost. they all loved the person i was, not this... nothingness. i'm just tired of the effort it takes to pretend i'm still here. it feels like i'm just waiting for the real end to catch up with the digital one. like, what is even the point of the charade if the soul of it is already gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
